                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b6f37afe-6716-3b47-9af3-9c8efb828766",
                        "entry_id": "0824daea-8196-3471-a7eb-809a0096ed28",
                        "glosses": [
                            "if, in case"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial",
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e200f67-6668-4099-a2c8-e4d44127ead9",
                                "sense_id": "b6f37afe-6716-3b47-9af3-9c8efb828766",
                                "text": "Е́жели поду́мать, да рассмотре́ть, то всё э́то глу́пости.",
                                "translation": "If we think about it and examine it, it is all nonsense.",
                                "english": "If we think about it and examine it, it is all nonsense."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "649f3213-e293-4d88-9585-ac3bf4e03dc3",
                                "sense_id": "b6f37afe-6716-3b47-9af3-9c8efb828766",
                                "text": "— Кому наука в пользу, а у кого только ум путается. Сестра — женщина непонимающая, норовит всё по благородному и хочет, чтоб из Егорки учёный вышел, а того не понимает, что я и при своих занятиях мог бы Егорку на век осчастливить. Я это к тому вам объясняю, что ежели все пойдут в учёные да в благородные, тогда некому будет торговать и хлеб сеять. Все с голоду поумирают.\n— А ежели все будут торговать и хлеб сеять, тогда некому будет учения постигать.",
                                "translation": "\"Learning is a benefit to some, but others only muddle their brains. My sister is a woman who does not understand; she is set upon refinement, and wants to turn Yegorka into a learned man, and she does not understand that with my business I could settle Yegorka happily for the rest of his life. I tell you this, that if everyone were to go in for being learned and refined there would be no one to sow the corn and do the trading; they would all die of hunger.\"\n\"And if all go in for trading and sowing corn there will be no one to acquire learning.\"",
                                "english": "\"Learning is a benefit to some, but others only muddle their brains. My sister is a woman who does not understand; she is set upon refinement, and wants to turn Yegorka into a learned man, and she does not understand that with my business I could settle Yegorka happily for the rest of his life. I tell you this, that if everyone were to go in for being learned and refined there would be no one to sow the corn and do the trading; they would all die of hunger.\"\n\"And if all go in for trading and sowing corn there will be no one to acquire learning.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
